    "content": "## Section Three\n\n| Column A | Column B |\n|----------|----------|\n| value 1  | value 2  |\n| value 3  | value 4  |\n\n### Nested Subsection\n\nContent in a nested subsection.",
    "limit": 10,
    "offset": 26,
    "path": "simple.md",
    "title": "Section Three"
  },
  {
    "content": "### PES PB WebClient Refactoring: 4.1x Bulk POST Throughput\n\nCommits `e67e728..d2832f2` on branch `pb1-2` validated via e2e on PaaS QA (2026-05-08):\n\n- Bulk POST rate: 23.7 -> **97.0 products/s** (4.1x improvement)\n- Root causes: `maxConcurrency` raised from 5 to 10 (env `PES_PB_MAX_CONCURRENCY`), WebClient refactored to share rate limiter across reactive operators via `RateLimiterOperator.of(rateLimiter)` in `Flux.flatMap`\n- PB-side latency also dropped from 10-15s to ~4s per batch (appears to be PB infrastructure variability, not client-side)\n- Total sync time: 40s -> **24s** (for 397 products, 8 batches of 50)\n- Delete rate unchanged at 1.0 deletes/s (rate-limited, sequential) -- PB has no batch DELETE API\n- Reactor threads used: 8 (of 10 max) vs 5 previously\n- S3 read: 2333 products in 2.1s; transform: 0.1s; bulk POST: 4.1s; reconcile list: 3.5s",
    "limit": 11,
    "offset": 13,
    "path": "lrn-multipart.md",
    "title": "PES PB WebClient Refactoring: 4.1x Bulk POST Throughput"
  },
  {
    "content": "## Deployment\n\nDeployed via CI pipeline to staging and production clusters.\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```yaml\nSTORE_URI: docstore+srv://cluster.example.net\nQUEUE_ENDPOINT: https://queue.region.example.com\nNOTIFY_BOOTSTRAP: notify.internal.example.net:9093\n```\n",
    "limit": 12,
    "offset": 38,
    "path": "service-doc.md",
    "title": "Deployment"
  },
  {
    "content": "## Troubleshooting\n\n### High Queue Backlog\n\nCheck consumer health via `/health/ready` endpoint.\nMonitor `queue.messages.consumed` counter in the dashboard.\n\n### Store Timeout\n\nVerify connection pool settings:\n- `maxPoolSize`: 50 (default)\n- `connectTimeoutMS`: 10000",
    "limit": 12,
    "offset": 50,
    "path": "service-doc.md",
    "title": "Troubleshooting"
  },
