    "content": "# Simple Test Document\n\n## Section One\n\nThis is the first section with some content.\n\n- Item 1\n- Item 2\n- Item 3\n\n## Section Two\n\nA section with a code block:\n\n```rust\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"hello\");\n}\n```\n\n## Section Three\n\n| Column A | Column B |\n|----------|----------|\n| value 1  | value 2  |\n| value 3  | value 4  |\n\n### Nested Subsection\n\nContent in a nested subsection.",
